{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09812","headline":"春日醴泉杜明府承恩五品宴席上赋诗 · 岑参","name":"春日醴泉杜明府承恩五品宴席上赋诗","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"凫舃旧称仙，鸿私降自天。\n青袍移草色，朱绶夺花然。\n邑里雷仍震，台中星欲悬。\n吾兄此栖棘，因得贺初筵。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"岑参","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_09812.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09812","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}